---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Contact" description="Contact Chassis Signal about corrections, product information updates, partnerships or general enquiries.">
  <header class="page-hero"><div class="shell page-hero-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">Contact the publication</p><h1>Send a useful signal.</h1><p class="lede">Corrections and source-backed product updates are especially welcome. The launch interface is ready for a form provider, but it does not pretend to deliver messages before one is configured.</p></div><div class="page-index"><span>04</span>Choose the closest subject so a future editorial workflow can route it correctly.</div></div></header>
  <section class="section"><div class="shell contact-grid"><div><p class="section-kicker">Enquiry types</p><h2>What can we help with?</h2><div class="contact-list"><div><strong>Editorial corrections</strong><span>Include the page, disputed claim and best available source.</span></div><div><strong>Product information</strong><span>Documentation changes, compatibility lists and specifications.</span></div><div><strong>Partnership enquiries</strong><span>Clearly disclose the organization and proposed arrangement.</span></div><div><strong>General enquiries</strong><span>Publication feedback and accessibility issues.</span></div></div></div>
    <form class="contact-form card-3d" data-tilt data-contact-form><p class="section-kicker">Message interface</p><label for="contact-topic">Subject</label><select id="contact-topic"><option>Editorial correction</option><option>Product information update</option><option>Partnership enquiry</option><option>General enquiry</option></select><label for="contact-name">Name</label><input id="contact-name" autocomplete="name" /><label for="contact-email">Email</label><input id="contact-email" type="email" autocomplete="email" /><label for="contact-message">Message</label><textarea id="contact-message"></textarea><button class="button" type="button" aria-describedby="form-note"><span>Delivery not configured</span></button><p class="form-note" id="form-note">Implementation point: connect this form to a verified Cloudflare Pages Function, Turnstile and email provider before enabling submission.</p></form>
  </div></section>
</BaseLayout>
